Package: MSE
Type: Package
Title: Management Strategy Evaluation for Antarctic Toothfish
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Alistair", "Dunn", 
           email = "alistair.dunn@example.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "YOUR-ORCID-ID"))
Description: 
    A closed-loop Management Strategy Evaluation (MSE) framework for 
    Antarctic toothfish (Dissostichus mawsoni). Provides operating model 
    forward projection, observation and implementation error simulation, 
    harvest control rules, and performance metric evaluation. Supports 
    spatial structure mismatch testing between operating and estimation 
    models using the SurplusProductionModel package as the assessment engine.
